{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WishList literally means \u201ca list of things you want.\u201d</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And if you don\u2019t hit that button\u2026 our little radio show might just get axed. \u2211(O_O\uff1b)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Someone out there once scoffed: \u201cJust scratching? That\u2019s not new\u2026 ever heard of a certain B*mania?\u201d</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Yeah, we\u2019ve heard of it.</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, you make music by swinging your mouse around like a maniac. (And if you actually feel the rhythm clicking with you\u2014trust us, that means the devs worked their butts off, so throw them some praise.) You\u2019ll also discover something profound: the true value of a good mouse pad. And let me be clear\u2014this control scheme is unlike anything else. At least on PC.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Think you can appreciate it without zooming in? Nope. <span class=\"bb_strike\">You can\u2019t possibly grasp the pure bliss of a motion perfectly synced to the sound\u2026 until you\u2019ve played it yourself.</span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[spoiler]Also, yes\u2026 jiggle physics are a blessing.[/spoiler]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the DJ, you\u2019ll get bizarre, borderline-impossible requests from eccentric listeners\u2014and you\u2019ll have to deliver. (We devs know the feeling\u2014we\u2019ve had to pull off our own share of absurd requests just to get tracks in.) Become a true fan of this game, and maybe\u2026 just maybe\u2026 we\u2019ll grant your request too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can never have too many 